abstract: >
  Conceptual AI framework for the AEROSONIC Sonifier ecosystem. Describes agents,
  architecture, anomaly detection, dreaming processes and data flows for real-time
  weather-driven musical systems. This repository contains documentation only and
  does not include source code or proprietary implementation details.

